{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112723","id":3006454432,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zMtqg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112723.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112723/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112723/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112723/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d462c8ea53b9529b3d479c624479c74e25973757","number":112723,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash after clearing `SpriteFrames`","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112576*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen clearing `SpriteFrames` for `AnimatedSprite2D`, the relevant `EditorPlugin` did not hide immediately. When clicking anywhere of `EditorPlugin`, the editor will crash.\r\n\r\n## Explaination\r\n\r\nThe `SpriteFramesEditor` observes the `sprite_frames_changed` signal of `AnimatedSprite2D`. But it didn't hide `EditorPlugin` in `_edit()` when clearing.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/e6aa06d3de372513bedb036d2adb1052a9b4b87f/editor/scene/sprite_frames_editor_plugin.cpp#L1962\r\n\r\n As described in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110280 , the bottom panel first `edit()`, then `make_visible(false)`, to hide the bottom panel plugin.\r\n\r\nBut in this scenario, `EditorInspector` called `SpriteFramesEditor::_edit()` directly, it didnot call `make_visible(false)`, so `EditorPlugin` is still there. But relevant `SpriteFrames` had been freed, so redraw caused crash.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nWe should hide `EditorPlugin` when clearing `SpriteFrames` of `AnimatedSprite2D`, then editor won't crash.\r\n\r\n[spriteframes.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a72aaac-0a3a-45e7-bcdc-a8c718fd57b8)\r\n\r\n## MRP\r\n\r\n[test-112576.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23523160/test-112576.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-11-13T10:50:33Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T18:34:54Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5M